     "<u></u> \r\n \r\n     \r\n         \r\n          \r\n         \r\n     \r\n    <div style=\"color:#333;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.429\"> \r\n        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#f5f5f5;border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n             \r\n            <tr> \r\n                <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:10px 20px\"> \r\n                    <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;vertical-align:top;width:32px;padding-right:8px\"> <img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/E6_HWzMqimXipP1lrDdZv0yfS1HEZMbVx0OUjw61-KgJHx6B71C8W0nW-x5wAJ87XSj4jpuAqt4yMTSlTZKuhzysG6-sh15iws4J6l7ja0z0Nn_wOLoAh7EkV8JO04Ap=s0-d-e1-ft#https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/887af8638abaf35842b85518ea2c1deb?d=mm&amp;s=48\" height=\"32\" width=\"32\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-radius:3px;vertical-align:top\"> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                            <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;vertical-align:middle;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> <a rel=\"piccolbo nofollow\" href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=piccolbo\" style=\"color:#3b73af;color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name%3Dpiccolbo&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241076910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0x05AHayVRjLLuk_AZsy4N\">Antonio Piccolboni</a> <strong>commented</strong> on <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-14\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-14&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241076910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yxgWL_503dMZi0lheudhN\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/92710e5b014f790c/?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Improvement\"> SPARKR-14</a> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                    </table> \r\n                </td> \r\n            </tr> \r\n            <tr> \r\n                <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:0 20px\"> \r\n                    <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:separate\"> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                             \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;color:#fff;padding:0 15px 0 16px;height:15px;background-color:#fff;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-top:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-bottom:0;border-top-right-radius:5px;border-top-left-radius:5px;height:10px;line-height:10px;padding:0 15px 0 16px\">\r\n                                 \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding-right:5px;font-size:20px;line-height:30px\"> <span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding:0;font-size:20px;line-height:30px;vertical-align:middle\"> <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-14\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-14&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241076910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yxgWL_503dMZi0lheudhN\">Re: Errors using SparkR with other packages</a> </span> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff;border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:0 0 10px 0\"> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0 0\">I am little skeptical of the initial analysis in the user group thread. Since the introduction of namespaces, if you develop a package that has base::save first in its search path, you can load whatever you want and it will use the base one, excluding nasty sabotage type things like AssignInNamespace. See <a href=\"http://homepage.stat.uiowa.edu/~luke/R/namespaces/morenames.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://homepage.stat.uiowa.edu/~luke/R/namespaces/morenames.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241076910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39RcqVEFClELugn7gru2Jo\">http://homepage.stat.uiowa.edu/~luke/R/namespaces/morenames.pdf</a> </p> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:10px 0 10px 24px;vertical-align:middle;padding-left:0\"> \r\n                                            <table align=\"left\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                                                <tr> \r\n                                                    <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:middle\"> <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-14#add-comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-14%23add-comment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241076910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dLnkWhZ5cSjQuLJtFKcbj\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/92710e5b014f790c/?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Add Comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> </a> \r\n                                                    </td> \r\n                                          